  "description": "Pandore is a modern luxury serif typeface that combines timeless elegance with a refined contemporary style. Designed with graceful letterforms and sophisticated details, this font brings a polished and high-end feel to every design. Its stylish presence makes Pandore perfect for creating eye-catching typography while maintaining a classy and professional appearance. Whether you’re building a luxury brand identity, designing elegant packaging, or creating beautiful editorial layouts, Pandore adds a touch of sophistication and exclusivity to your visuals.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Pandore is a modern luxury serif typeface that combines timeless elegance with a refined contemporary style. Designed with graceful letterforms and sophisticated details, this font brings a polished and high-end feel to every design. Its stylish presence makes Pandore perfect for creating eye-catching typography while maintaining a classy and professional appearance. Whether you’re building a luxury brand identity, designing elegant packaging, or creating beautiful editorial layouts, Pandore adds a touch of sophistication and exclusivity to your visuals.</p>",
